sequenceDiagram
    participant Boot as Android Launcher
    participant Main as MainActivity
    participant Config as ConfigManager
    participant Multi as MultiViewActivity
    participant Player as PlayerActivity

    Note over Boot,Main: 冷/热启动恢复
    Boot->>Main: onCreate/onResume(首次)
    Main->>Config: getLastViewMode()
    alt last_view_mode == "single"
        Main->>Player: startActivity(channel_index=lastChannelIndex, stream=lastStreamType)
    else last_view_mode == "multi"
        Main->>Multi: startActivity(layout=lastMultiLayout)
    else 无记忆
        Main->>Main: 显示列表页(维持现状)
    end

    Note over Main,Player: 正常从列表进入
    Main->>Player: onChannelClick(ch) startActivity
    Player->>Player: onCreate 读 EXTRA → playChannel(ch, sub)

    Note over Multi,Player: 多画面运行
    User->>Multi: 进入多画面(D-pad/按钮)
    Multi->>Config: getLastMultiLayout()/isMultiUseSub()
    Multi->>Multi: 创建 N=layout slots + engines (只建不播)
    loop 每格可见时
        Multi->>Engine: play(url, sub=multi_use_sub)
        Engine->>V: media.play()
        V-->>Engine: Playing 事件
        Engine-->>Tile: onPlayingChanged
    end
    User->>Multi: OK / 单击当前格
    Multi->>Config: setLastChannelIndex(ch); setLastStreamType(sub/main)
    Multi->>Player: startActivity(ch, from_multi=true, stream=...)
    Player-->>Multi: BACK 返回
    User->>Multi: DPAD_CENTER 长按 / 双击 → switchLayout(下一档)
    Multi->>Multi: stop 旧格 → 重建新格 slots
    User->>Multi: MENU → 切换子/主
    Multi->>Config: setMultiUseSub(!cur)
    User->>Multi: BACK
    Multi->>Config: setLastViewMode("multi") + setLastMultiLayout
    Multi->>Multi: finish()